\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces The privacy--utility frontier on the basin prototypes is flat across the practical privacy regime. Tightening the differential-privacy budget on the per-class summaries through the single-digit $\varepsilon $ typical of differentially private learning leaves the global model's accuracy essentially unchanged; it falls only under the most stringent budget, $\varepsilon =0.5$ (MNIST, $N=10$).}}{11}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dpfrontier}{{8}{11}{The privacy--utility frontier on the basin prototypes is flat across the practical privacy regime. Tightening the differential-privacy budget on the per-class summaries through the single-digit $\varepsilon $ typical of differentially private learning leaves the global model's accuracy essentially unchanged; it falls only under the most stringent budget, $\varepsilon =0.5$ (MNIST, $\Nc =10$)}{figure.8}{}}
